6. While preparing a data set for an AI system dealing with patient data, Nora needs to determine
    which of the following information qualifies as sensitive personal information (SPI) and needs
    to be removed from the data set. Which of the following would be considered SPI?

    - Marital status

    - Patient name ✅

    - Body Mass Index (BMI)

    - Annual income range

    💡Correct! The patient name is the only piece of information that would allow someone to be
    easily identified and could be used to significantly harm or inconvenience an individual.


